  "uuid": "707ce403-190a-8d0a-b5e6-a83527512de4",
  "created_at": "2025-12-15T12:58:30-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Utilities",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ivan Varela",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Priya Raman",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:57:22-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Utilities billing, this is Priya. How can I help?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:57:26-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, sure. Ivan Varela, I'm at 267 Dixon Street, up the North End. My water and sewer bill came and it's way higher than normal. They put in a new meter last month, so, I mean, that's gotta be it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:57:39-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. A new meter can change the reading, so I'll note that on the account. Do you know what the bill usually runs?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:57:46-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, it's about double. Which, great, thanks. Sorry, hang on, my coworker's pulling in, he always honks twice. [pause] Okay. Anyway, is a payment plan possible? Of course I'll pay it, I just can't do it all at once."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:57:58-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, we can look at that. I'd put in a request for a review of the meter reading first, and someone will call you about the plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:58:07-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure. And I want to pay something before the weekend. How do I do that once you're closed? Online, or a drop box or something?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:58:15-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You can pay online anytime through the city website, and there's a payment drop box at City Hall. Your bill has the account number you'll need."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:58:23-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Of course, got it. Okay, thanks. The number's 401-555-0188 if they call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:58:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. Thank you, Mr. Varela."
    }
  ],
